    "work_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in",
    "canonical_ref": "PL61.IN.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Celare se non pertulit, Qui triste funus edidit, Et si nocere desiit, Insana vita prodiit. Deceptus arte noxia Cassata deflet crimina, Dum quæ putabat tristia, Conversa sunt in gaudia.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 400,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      420
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in#PL61.IN.3",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in",
    "canonical_ref": "PL61.IN.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Exempla sæva protulit, Calcanda cuncto tempore, Ut jam sibi conscriberet Decreta vivo antistitc.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 400,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      420
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in#PL61.IN.4",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in",
    "canonical_ref": "PL61.IN.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Fucata res hæc contigit Vitanda casto pectore, Superstite ut præsumeret, Post fata quod vix defuit. Gravat sacerdos ordinem Qui episcopatum sic petit, Praecepta qui complectitur Fugit honoris ambitum.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 400,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      420
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in#PL61.IN.5",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in",
    "canonical_ref": "PL61.IN.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "lloc si cui sit debitum Coactus ascendat gradum, Non se petente callide, Sed dante Christi muncre. Ineptus est quis ipse se Præferre vult Ecclesiæ : Nam rem sacratam sumere Electio divina sit.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 400,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      420
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in#PL61.IN.6",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in",
    "canonical_ref": "PL61.IN.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Carus sacerdos ordinem Hilarius non ambiit, Martinus illud effugit, Gregorius vix sustulit.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 400,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      420
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in#PL61.IN.7",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/amoenus/pl61_8_in",
    "canonical_ref": "PL61.IN.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Leges refutant ambitum, Invasor omnis pellitur, Quod respuunt pratoria, Vitet nefas Ecclesia.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 400,
    "date_range": [
      380,
